{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(This_is_a_joke)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (This is a joke)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(FASTEST_METHOD!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (FASTEST METHOD!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser(EASY_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser(EASY AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a19c45a0925ddc8581841737fa4b5f3dab44c877.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{11!-10!}{9!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"39\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e778d06a5f2a59bb626a8969ca89e778ddf9cf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 99\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 100\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 110\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 121\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use subtraction of fractions to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d8e4e6c76063dc4767a679ab11d828b652b9470.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{11!-10!}{9!} = \\frac{11!}{9!} - \\frac{10!}{9!} = 110 -10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\;100}.\\]\" width=\"363\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/f/22f925a6f7de3d6e06f740617bc11b55a1f97184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da090448053677bb93690ce2e7acf27173b840d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11!-10!}{9!} = \\frac{9!(11 \\cdot 10 - 10)}{9!} = 110-10=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"408\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a19c45a0925ddc8581841737fa4b5f3dab44c877.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{11!-10!}{9!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"39\" />\nconsider 10 as n \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2d4b1a9e19737fca77f802507f5ae1e5c0c697a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{(n+1)!-n!}{(n-1)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"105\" height=\"45\" />\nsimpify \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b46392398b349258c92314b25fd3bf6cd686f846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{(n+1)n!+(-1)n!}{(n-1)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"154\" height=\"45\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313ab014122603d7877e535a0d2fd1641b293da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{n(n!)}{(n-1)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"67\" height=\"45\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f5a3fa51a60c15ecbf6b8b1d2398ba9ecd8adf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{n(n(n-1)!)}{(n-1)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"103\" height=\"45\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/2/1c2fc3ecdc80793afa668ae4ac550644a1b390f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{n(n)(1)}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"40\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/0/580903a62163774d0ee278a25f11118dd2a8b2c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{n^2}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"41\" />\nsubsitute n as 10 again  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/147635907c772855277084cb14e60dabf9160030.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{10^2}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"31\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db61fd75a1a8bb6fa2b202b6b73daf9b4c9838d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/0/a50c33afb2ca0bca25be79c77b2018c27f355812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/180a7757cc82828ce97857ba6808515e106b58a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11!-10!}{9!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>This is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/7/f575d8f742c429738e57393f4507f45be5c8df23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11(10!) - 1(10!)}{9!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" />\nSimplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb94b26d265bae2ff075cccc61196b94e463ad8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(11-1)(10!)}{9!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"107\" height=\"40\" />, which equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b868bf3ef9b5d60b9a2077011e23cd1420cef24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db61fd75a1a8bb6fa2b202b6b73daf9b4c9838d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/0/a50c33afb2ca0bca25be79c77b2018c27f355812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}~100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"74\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~TheGoldenRetriever\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28This_is_a_joke.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(This_is_a_joke)\">Solution 5 (This is a joke)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (This is a joke)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b252314c2d55a971ec2ba5a75809473367597672.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[I_n := \\int_0^\\infty x^n e^{-x} \\, dx = n!\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"41\" />\n(the Gamma–integral).\n</p><p>Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c281c9ec1d48df66974d1584b56d7802565e5c7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{11! - 10!}{9!} = \\frac{I_{11} - I_{10}}{I_9} = \\frac{\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x} (x^{11} - x^{10}) \\, dx}{I_9}.\\]\" width=\"361\" height=\"44\" />\nIntegration by parts on the numerator with \\( u = x^{11} - x^{10} \\), \\( dv = e^{-x} \\, dx \\) (so \\( du = (11x^{10} - 10x^9) \\, dx \\), \\( v = -e^{-x} \\)) gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd9a031de5edb84db7611e4436b8a7b4bf834b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x} (x^{11} - x^{10}) \\, dx = \\left[ -e^{-x} (x^{11} - x^{10}) \\right]_0^\\infty + \\int_0^\\infty e^{-x} (11x^{10} - 10x^9) \\, dx = 11 I_{10} - 10 I_9,\\]\" width=\"663\" height=\"41\" />\nsince the boundary term vanishes.\n</p><p>Hence\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efacbb90738232fd0f794835bd9b9fdf9274ea93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{I_{11} - I_{10}}{I_9} = \\frac{11 I_{10}}{I_9} - 10.\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"40\" />\nDo another integration by parts to relate \\( I_{10} \\) and \\( I_9 \\):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2167df1f69a7aac6dce0bd9b75e66a47216ba1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[I_{10} = \\int_0^\\infty x^{10} e^{-x} \\, dx = \\left[ -x^{10} e^{-x} \\right]_0^\\infty + 10 \\int_0^\\infty x^9 e^{-x} \\, dx = 10 I_9.\\]\" width=\"482\" height=\"41\" />\nTherefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/a/98a0ac68145d806afbd9ecf7822924e59966b997.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{I_{11} - I_{10}}{I_9} = 11 \\cdot 10 - 10 = 100.\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e50291edda92e5eab8457577908dde1d8e66b025.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(B) 100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"69\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p><p>~Minorly Edited by OffBrandCab\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/r5G98oPPyNM\">https://youtu.be/r5G98oPPyNM</a>\n</pre>\n<p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w\">https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CrS7oHDrvP8\">https://youtu.be/CrS7oHDrvP8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28FASTEST_METHOD.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(FASTEST_METHOD!)\">Video Solution (FASTEST METHOD!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (FASTEST METHOD!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jowREGsZaTs\">https://youtu.be/jowREGsZaTs</a>\n</p><p>~Veer Mahajan\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser.28EASY_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser(EASY_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD)\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser(EASY AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by cutoffchaser(EASY AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vC51hu_jJGE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vC51hu_jJGE</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A\">2016 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A P